# FitMe Mobile Environment Configuration
#
# Environment Routing Architecture:
# - DEVELOPMENT (__DEV__ === true):
#   iOS Simulator / Web: automatically defaults to http://127.0.0.1:8000
#   Android Emulator:    automatically defaults to http://10.0.2.2:8000
#
# - PHYSICAL DEVICE DEV TESTING (Optional override):
#   If testing on a physical phone over local Wi-Fi, set your Mac's LAN IP below:
#   EXPO_PUBLIC_DEV_API_URL=http://192.168.1.50:8000
#
# - PRODUCTION (__DEV__ === false):
#   Release builds & standalone APKs automatically lock to:
#   https://fitmeapptesting-1-production.up.railway.app
